  <metadata>
    <name>Turó de l&apos;Home Loop</name>
    <desc>Girona&apos;s longest classic — a full day in the saddle climbing to the highest point in the Montseny massif. Remote forest roads, dramatic altitude gain, and the rewarding descent back through the Selva.</desc>
